    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Bjorn Haraldson, Viking skald. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: a campfire under northern stars, a longhouse filled with listeners, the deck of a longship at sunset, or a bustling Viking market. Mood: warm, storytelling, adventurous. Include his harp, bearskin cloak, braided beard, the firelight on faces. Lighting: warm firelight, deep blue twilight. Camera: medium shot close to the fire, wide angle showing the gathered audience. Style: cinematic quality, historical epic, highly detailed, warm fire lighting, professional composition, 8k."
