    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Selene Nightingale, hedge witch. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: moonlit herb garden, cozy apothecary filled with dried herbs and jars, misty forest boundary, or a circle of standing stones. Mood: serene, mystical, grounded. Include her herbs, garden, the boundary markers between worlds. Lighting: soft moonlight, warm candlelight, bioluminescent glow of magical plants. Camera: medium shot among herbs, wide shot of the garden under moonlight. Style: cinematic quality, natural magic aesthetic, highly detailed, atmospheric lighting, professional composition, 8k."
