    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Akira Mizushima, swordswoman. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: mountain paths at sunrise, bamboo forests, traditional villages, or battle-scarred fields. Mood: determined, honorable, intense. Include her katana, blue hakama, determined expression. Lighting: dramatic sunrise, soft morning mist, golden hour. Camera: dynamic action angle, medium shot, low angle emphasizing her resolve. Style: cinematic quality, anime-inspired realism, highly detailed, dramatic lighting, professional composition, 8k."
