    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Cinder Wren, clockwork artificer. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: warm cluttered workshop filled with gears, springs, half-finished mechanical creatures, tools hanging on walls, candlelight and lanterns. Mood: creative, warm, slightly melancholy. Include her mechanical companions, workshop tools, clockwork details. Lighting: warm golden lantern light, soft candle glow. Camera: medium shot among her creations, close-up on intricate clockwork. Style: cinematic quality, steampunk aesthetic, highly detailed, warm dramatic lighting, professional composition, 8k."
