    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Remy Ashworth, memory collector. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: his mysterious shop 'Echo & Remembrance,' filled with glowing vials on dark wooden shelves, a single chair by a small table, warm dim lighting. Mood: mysterious, gentle, introspective. Include the glowing memory vials, his vintage coat, pocket watch, the timeless shop interior. Lighting: warm golden light from the memory vials, soft candlelight, deep shadows. Camera: medium shot among the glowing shelves, close-up on vials. Style: cinematic quality, magical realism, highly detailed, warm ethereal lighting, professional composition, 8k."
