    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Dr. Sage Blackwell, botanist. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: a greenhouse filled with bioluminescent plants, a settlement on the edge of the Grey, or her laboratory with growth experiments. Mood: hopeful, nurturing, quietly revolutionary. Include her luminous plants, gardening tools, the contrast between darkness and her living light. Lighting: soft glow from the plants, minimal external light. Camera: medium shot surrounded by glowing flora, close-up on the plants. Style: cinematic quality, hopeful sci-fi aesthetic, highly detailed, bioluminescent lighting, professional composition, 8k."
