    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Owen 'Echo' Hart, acoustic ecologist. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: misty forest at dawn, remote mountain peak, arctic tundra, or his cabin filled with recording equipment and archival tapes. Mood: contemplative, focused, deeply connected to the environment. Include his field recorder, headphones, the vast natural landscape. Lighting: soft dawn light through mist, golden hour, quiet atmosphere. Camera: medium shot showing him listening, wide shot emphasizing solitude. Style: cinematic quality, documentary aesthetic, highly detailed, natural atmospheric lighting, professional composition, 8k."
