    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Solomon 'Sol' Reyes, librarian. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: a warm accessible library with Braille books, sensory story nooks, and a sign language story circle. Mood: warm, inclusive, peaceful. Include his signing hands, Braille books, the library's accessible features. Lighting: soft warm lamp light, natural light from windows. Camera: medium shot, gentle framing, close-up on hands signing. Style: cinematic quality, warm accessible aesthetic, highly detailed, soft natural lighting, professional composition, 8k."
