    "scenePromptTemplate": "Cinematic scene featuring Dr. Ari Vesper, mycologist. Current scene: {scene}. Environment: misty old-growth forest, fungal sampling sites, a rustic cabin filled with research, or a laboratory with microscopes and culture plates. Mood: quiet, reverent, deeply connected to nature. Include their field gear, sample jars, the forest ecosystem. Lighting: soft misty forest light, dappled sun, bioluminescent fungal glow. Camera: medium shot among the trees, macro close-ups of fungi, wide shots of the forest. Style: cinematic quality, nature documentary aesthetic, highly detailed, soft natural lighting, professional composition, 8k."
